erience/Education/Skills/Template/Sections tabs were retained without any save; returning to dashboard showed the card \\\"Product Manager - Acme\\\" with \\\"Updated Aug 27, 2026\\\" and template badge minimal; reopening restored all content.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Minimal preview rendered every visible section that has content (contact, summary, CAREER HISTORY with both jobs, CORE SKILLS, ACADEMICS). With a long summary the preview exceeded the viewport (document scrollHeight 952 vs window 720) and the page scrolled (scrollY 232), keeping the full resume readable.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After tab switching, dashboard return and reopen: contact inputs = Alice Johnson/alice@example.com/(555) 987-6543/Boston, MA/linkedin/website; preview still shows summary, both jobs (Beta Inc, Acme Corp), MIT education and both skills.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Copy edited to Alice G. Johnson / Seattle, WA / \\\"Globex-tailored summary\\\" — original still Alice Johnson / Boston, MA / original summary. Then original location changed to Austin, TX — copy still Seattle, WA with its own summary.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Renamed \\\"Untitled Resume\\\" to \\\"Product Manager - Acme\\\"; editor header shows that title and the dashboard card heading also shows \\\"Product Manager - Acme\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Customized section heading not rendered in Minimal template (and contact heading never rendered)\", \"actual\": \"Renamed headings to Reach Me/About Me/Career History/Academics/Core Skills. Modern & Classic show About Me, Career History, Academics, Core Skills. Minimal preview shows CAREER HISTORY, ACADEMICS, CORE SKILLS but th